# Backend

Django + DRF. Postgres is the source of truth. Redis is cache/broker, not the system of record.

- Settings via env names only; never paste secret values.
- Migrations are backward compatible. Dangerous behavior behind a flag.
- Every endpoint: authz test that fails if permission is removed.
- Telegram bot is a separate process from https://github.com/XasanovOzodjon/Telegram-Bot-template.
- Do not edit frontend trees.
